{"id":"steam-323080","steam":323080,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Flesh & Bone","summary":"In a world filled with strange machines, battle flying swarms - a first in VR - and if you survive long enough, get obliterated by the MOTHER OF SWARM.\r\nFLESH & BONE is the most brutal 90s survival arena with ZERO hand holding and the freedom to chose your play style: melee, range, turret, hijack!","about":"FLESH & BONE is the most BRUTAL, 90s SURVIVAL arena with exactly ZERO hand holding. \n\nChose your play style and combine 3 vastly different strategies: \n\n\r\n\nHAND OF BONE to wield NECROMAGIC for range combat and hijacking enemy brains into  your army.\n\nHAND OF FLESH to wield TECHNOMANCY for acrobatic melee combat and turret defense!\n\nOr combine both. \n\nUpgrade your puny life from  victim to a LEAPING GOD OF DEAH.\n\nUnleashing destruction high up above the battlefield.\n\n Run faster than the enemy and impose decisive PACIFICATION!\n\n\r\n\nFeatures:\n\n \n\n• \nZERO TUTORIAL OR OPTIONS because hand holding is for babies\n• \nSWARMS of thousands of enemies on-screen, with one goal in life: to serve you punishment\n• \n3 vastly different gameplay strategies with combinations\n• \nGIANT CREATURES\n• \nULTRA dynamic movement where you can leap HIGH above the enemy - vomit bag not included.\n• \nGem and crystal upgrades \n• \nUnlock permanent abilities \n\n\r\n\n \n\nNeed TUTORIALS to hold you lil hand? Don't buy this! Instead, go rent a TARTAN PRANCER!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/ddea8497bec3fd1b837f8cf5f843194b5315b8e3/library_capsule.jpg?t=1789751883","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/01208a6b2ca34f22dc21c1b06c639de710f00050/header.jpg?t=1789751883","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/90899923aa740f75c6681d41d9b3382d008a959c/library_hero.jpg?t=1789751883","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.